      nDarbaza: "Country-folk from the cafés at the gate of Talas Air Base, which gives the cassette its name. Their second album.",
      nEkiKysh: "Three men, three instruments and no guests: the band's plainest record and their first as a trio. Altyn-Zhylky album prize, 2002.",
      nEkiMinToi: "Wedding songs from the bus-station cassettes, 1997 to 2012: one man and one keyboard doing the work of a band. Ten songs for every kind of feast.",
